    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this attractive land plot zoned for Residential Development extending to approximately 0.23 hectares (0.56 acres). Ideally situated in the scenic popular residential area of Killaneen, but within easy access to the thriving Shannon Erne Waterways town of Ballinamore, Co. Leitrim. This plot is zoned Residential and has accessibility  to mains water and sewerage services. Potential buyers are given the  rare opportunity to design and build their very own dream home.\r\n\r\nContained within Folio No. LM10387, this plot is located just off the main Carrick on Shannon Road . Conveniently located within easy reach of Ballinamore and its range of local amenities, schools, Library, bus network and theatre to name a few. The property combines the peace and privacy of the Leitrim countryside with excellent accessibility. Further details, maps and particulars are available from the Sole Selling Agent."
      },
